{"seq":9,"slug":"resilience-engineering-failure-recovery","title":"韧性工程与故障恢复","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery","rating":{"composite":4.21,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"韧性工程与故障恢复-简介\">韧性工程与故障恢复 简介</h1><p>分布式系统里，故障不是异常而是常态：机器会宕、网络会抖、依赖会慢、流量会突增。韧性工程关心的不是「如何不出故障」，而是「故障必然发生时，系统能否把影响控制在局部、自动恢复、并对用户尽量无感」。本 hub 面向后端工程师，讲的是系统级、架构层面的韧性——它和单次调用的限流、熔断、重试、幂等是互补关系：那些是把单个调用做对的基础原语，而这里讨论的是把成百上千个调用、服务与资源组织成一个「整体不会被一处故障拖垮」的系统。</p>\n<p>为什么这件事重要？现代后端早已不是单体，而是层层依赖的服务网。一个慢查询、一个被打满的线程池、一次依赖超时，都可能沿调用链放大，最终演成全站雪崩。绝大多数大规模线上事故，根因不在「某个组件坏了」，而在「一个局部故障没有被隔离，于是扩散成了系统故障」。能把故障收敛在边界内、让系统优雅地少做一点而不是彻底罢工，往往比追求更高的单点可用性更划算，也更现实。</p>\n<p>本 hub 沿四章展开，由近及远。第一章「级联故障与隔离」剖析故障如何在调用链上放大，以及用舱壁、隔离与资源边界切断传播路径，是全篇的问题起点。第二章「优雅降级与容错」讲在依赖不可用时如何退而求其次——返回兜底、关闭非核心、保住主链路，让系统「带病可用」而非整体不可用。第三章「背压与流量控制」转向过载视角：当上游产能超过下游处理能力时，如何用背压、排队与负载卸除把压力反馈回去、把系统稳在安全工作区间，而不是被无限堆积压垮。第四章「混沌工程与灾难恢复」则把视角拉到验证与兜底——主动注入故障来检验前三章的假设是否成立，并为真正的灾难准备备份、演练与恢复预案。</p>\n<p>贯穿全篇的一条主线是：韧性不是某个单点机制，而是一种「为失败而设计」的系统属性——先承认会坏，再把坏的代价设计成可控、可隔离、可恢复；而任何未经主动验证的韧性，都只是一种乐观的假设。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cascading-failure-and-isolation","title":"级联故障与隔离","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cascading-failure-anatomy","title":"级联故障的解剖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation/cascading-failure-anatomy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bulkhead-isolation","title":"舱壁隔离模式：把故障关进水密舱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation/bulkhead-isolation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"timeout-and-budget-propagation","title":"超时与预算传播：让整条调用链共享同一个\"还剩多久\"","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/cascading-failure-and-isolation/timeout-and-budget-propagation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance","title":"优雅降级与容错","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graceful-degradation-patterns","title":"优雅降级模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance/graceful-degradation-patterns"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fallback-and-default-strategies","title":"回退与默认值策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance/fallback-and-default-strategies"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-flags-and-load-shedding","title":"特性开关与负载卸载","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/graceful-degradation-and-fault-tolerance/feature-flags-and-load-shedding"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"backpressure-and-flow-control","title":"背压与流量控制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/backpressure-and-flow-control","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"backpressure-fundamentals","title":"背压的基本原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/backpressure-and-flow-control/backpressure-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"queue-and-buffer-management","title":"队列与缓冲管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/backpressure-and-flow-control/queue-and-buffer-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"adaptive-concurrency-limiting","title":"自适应并发限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/backpressure-and-flow-control/adaptive-concurrency-limiting"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery","title":"混沌工程与灾难恢复","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-engineering-practice","title":"混沌工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery/chaos-engineering-practice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-region-failover","title":"多区域故障转移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery/multi-region-failover"},{"seq":3,"slug":"rto-rpo-and-dr-strategy","title":"RTO/RPO 与灾备策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/resilience-engineering-failure-recovery/chaos-engineering-and-disaster-recovery/rto-rpo-and-dr-strategy"}]}]}